{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52540","headline":"晚春旋漳会酌 · 陈元光","name":"晚春旋漳会酌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝德符三极，皇风振四夷。\n将轺春暮饮，士卒岭南驰。\n马啸腥风远，兵歌暖日怡。\n妖云驱屏迹，芳卉媚迎诗。\n拍掌横弓槊，徘徊索酒巵。\n阴处窜蛇豕，暗笑使君迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}